  "about": "One entry per setup step (S-ids from the setup record, section 3, plus GH-ids for GitHub settings the record lists without an S-id). Read by scripts/release/setup-state.mjs (npm run release:ready). Public identifiers only. Minutes are hands-on estimates, waits not included. ledger is the setup record's word and its date; a probe, when it runs, wins over it.",
